## Phase 7 — Agent & Workflow Engine

* orchestrator;
* planner;
* task decomposition;
* multi-agent execution;
* persistent state;
* checkpoints;
* pause/resume/abort;
* human approval;
* recovery.

## Phase 8 — Advanced AI

* advanced context;
* improved memory;
* evaluation;
* optimization;
* advanced orchestration;
* multi-agent experimentation.

